=== layout: section
# What are the parental phenotypes and genotypes for a color-blind female?

=== layout: two-panels
# Wild-type Male and Carrier Female

@left

![Slide image 28](assets/lect06d-x_linked_genes_1/image_028.png)

@right

- If a carrier mates with a male who has normal color vision
- there is a 50% chance that each daughter will be a carrier like her mother
- and a 50% chance that each son will have the disorder

=== layout: two-panels
# Carrier Female and Color-Blind Male

@left

- If a carrier mates with a color-blind male,
- regardless of sex,
- there is a 50% chance that each child born to them will have the disorder,

@right

![Slide image 29](assets/lect06d-x_linked_genes_1/image_029.png)

