# Sample Problems

=== layout: multiple-choice
@question

Red-green color blindness is a X-linked recessive trait in humans.
Two people with wild-type color vision (N) have a color-blind son (b).
What are the genotypes of the parents?

- A) X&#x1D3A;X&#x1D3A; and X&#x1D3A;Y
- B) X&#x1D3A;X&#x1D47; and X&#x1D3A;Y
- C) X&#x1D47;X&#x1D47; and X&#x1D47;Y
- D) X&#x1D3A;X&#x1D47; and X&#x1D47;Y

@answer

[Answer\: B]{color=red}

